    <statement><p>A woman exerts a horizontal force of 1 pounds on a box as she pushes it up a
ramp that is 2 feet long and inclined at an angle of 30 degrees above the
horizontal.</p>
<p>The force vector is F = <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>The displacement vector is d = <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p>Find the work done on the box.</p>
<p>Work = F<m>\cdot</m>d =  <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0003"/> ft-lb</p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;1,0\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\left&lt;1.73205,1\right&gt;</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{1\cdot 2\sqrt{3}}{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
